# src/generated_contracts.rs is NOT ignored (was, PMAT-131 2026-03-29).
# It is generated by `pv codegen contracts/ -o src/generated_contracts.rs`, but
# its 165 INPUT yamls do not live in this repo -- they are aprender's contracts.
# `pv codegen` over ruchy's own contracts/ (2 files, no pre/post/invariants)
# emits nothing, while src/ calls 460 of these macros, so a clean checkout
# cannot build: E0583 "file not found for module `generated_contracts`".
# CI only stayed green because self-hosted runners reuse a persistent _work
# directory where the ignored artifact survives between runs.
# Until codegen is reproducible from inputs inside this repo, the file is
# source, not an artifact, and is tracked. See PMAT-131.

# PMAT-092: scratch directories with ':' in the name break Windows checkouts
# and `cargo install` tarball extraction. Keep them local/untracked instead
# of renaming, so existing pmat tooling that creates them is unaffected.
# The glob `*` matches any character including unicode (e.g. the U+2192
# RIGHTWARDS ARROW used in some Apex Hunt directory names), so one pattern
# covers every observed variant — all of them start with "Apex Hunt: ...".
.pmat-work/*:*

# PMAT-136: dogfood receipts (written by the ruchy-dogfood skill)
.dogfood/
